# 低频词汇 List01
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024恋练有词
# 描述: 低频词汇List01核心词汇

{{abolish}}{/əˈbɒlɪʃ/}{废除；取消}{The parliament voted to abolish the death penalty.}}
{{abrupt}}{/əˈbrʌpt/}{突然的；唐突的}{The abrupt change in policy caught everyone off guard.}}
{{absorb}}{/əbˈzɔːb/}{吸收；吸引}{The sponge absorbs water quickly.}}
{{abundance}}{/əˈbʌndəns/}{丰富；充裕}{The region has an abundance of natural resources.}}
{{abuse}}{/əˈbjuːs/}{滥用；虐待}{The report documented cases of power abuse within the organization.}}
{{accommodate}}{/əˈkɒmədeɪt/}{容纳；适应}{The venue can accommodate up to 1,000 guests.}}
{{accomplish}}{/əˈkʌmplɪʃ/}{完成；实现}{She accomplished every goal she set for herself.}}
{{accumulate}}{/əˈkjuːmjuleɪt/}{积累；堆积}{Over time, small savings can accumulate into a large sum.}}
{{accurate}}{/ˈækjərət/}{精确的；准确的}{The weather forecast was surprisingly accurate.}}
{{admire}}{/ədˈmaɪər/}{钦佩；欣赏}{I admire her courage in speaking out against injustice.}}
{{admission}}{/ədˈmɪʃn/}{准入；承认}{Admission to the program requires a minimum GPA of 3.5.}}
{{adventure}}{/ədˈventʃər/}{冒险；冒险经历}{Traveling to unfamiliar places is always an adventure.}}
{{adversary}}{/ˈædvəsəri/}{对手；敌手}{The two adversaries met for the final round of negotiations.}}
{{affirm}}{/əˈfɜːm/}{肯定；确认}{The court affirmed the lower court's decision.}}
{{agony}}{/ˈæɡəni/}{极度痛苦}{The patient was in agony until the medication took effect.}}
{{aircraft}}{/ˈeəkrɑːft/}{飞机；航空器}{The aircraft was forced to make an emergency landing.}}
{{alarm}}{/əˈlɑːm/}{警报；惊恐}{The discovery alarmed environmental groups worldwide.}}
{{alcohol}}{/ˈælkəhɒl/}{酒精；酒}{Excessive alcohol consumption is linked to liver disease.}}
{{allege}}{/əˈledʒ/}{指控；宣称}{The report alleged that the company had violated regulations.}}
{{alliance}}{/əˈlaɪəns/}{联盟；同盟}{The alliance between the two nations strengthened over time.}}
{{allocate}}{/ˈæləkeɪt/}{分配；拨出}{The government allocated additional funds for education.}}
{{allot}}{/əˈlɒt/}{分配；拨出}{Each team was allotted 30 minutes for their presentation.}}
{{alongside}}{/əˌlɒŋˈsaɪd/}{在...旁边；与...一起}{The new building stands alongside the historic church.}}
{{ambition}}{/æmˈbɪʃn/}{野心；抱负}{Her ambition to become a doctor started at a young age.}}
{{amid}}{/əˈmɪd/}{在...之中}{The company grew rapidly amid economic uncertainty.}}
{{analogy}}{/əˈnælədʒi/}{类比；类似}{The professor drew an analogy between the brain and a network.}}
{{anchor}}{/ˈæŋkər/}{锚；主持人}{The news anchor delivered the breaking story with composure.}}
{{anniversary}}{/ˌænɪˈvɜːsəri/}{周年纪念}{The university celebrated its centennial anniversary.}}
{{anonymous}}{/əˈnɒnɪməs/}{匿名的；无名的}{The anonymous donor contributed a large sum to the charity.}}
{{apparatus}}{/ˌæpəˈreɪtəs/}{器械；机构}{The experiment requires specialized scientific apparatus.}}
